config BR2_PACKAGE_MALI_KBASE_SUNXI
	bool "mali-kbase-sunxi"
	depends on BR2_LINUX_KERNEL
	help
	  Mali kbase kernel driver taken from the Allwinner BSP kernel's own
	  modules/gpu tree and built against this board's kernel.

	  Unlike mali-kbase, the version is whatever the BSP ships (r20p0-01rel0
	  on the orangepi H618 tree), with the sunxi platform glue, and it has
	  to match the userspace blob: mali-g31-fbdev is r20p0-01rel0 as well.

comment "mali-kbase-sunxi needs a Linux kernel to be built"
	depends on !BR2_LINUX_KERNEL
